{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Ranger Adaptation: one single-target Adaptation per Ranger on each target (#6113)",
  "contract": [
    "Footpad's Adaptation (523489 chain, max rank 523493: 285 armor and 12 of each attribute) and Woodsman's",
    "Adaptation (800266 chain, max rank 803666: 232 attack power) are separate chains. On Ascension the later",
    "single-target Adaptation from the same Ranger removes the earlier one on that target, in either order;",
    "another Ranger's Adaptation stays beside it, and Greater Footpad's 523513 and Greater Woodsman's 680294 from",
    "one Ranger coexist. spell_group 2110010 (523489, 800266) with SPELL_GROUP_STACK_RULE_EXCLUSIVE_FROM_SAME_CASTER",
    "(2) gives that per-caster rule; 2100002 and 2100003 keep each single-target buff one per target with its",
    "Greater version. Expected on a grouped warrior ally: the first Ranger's Woodsman's removes its Footpad's",
    "and the Footpad's armor (+309) is gone; Footpad's then removes Woodsman's; the second Ranger's Woodsman's",
    "lands beside the first Ranger's Footpad's; the first Ranger's Greater Footpad's and Greater Woodsman's then",
    "replace both single-target buffs and stay together at +309 armor and +232 attack power."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
